<mxCell id="legenda" value="&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:2px 6px;text-align:left&quot;&gt;tracejado&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:2px 6px;text-align:left&quot;&gt;a mesma máquina; ela aparece uma vez em cada rede em que está (mesma cor), com o IP daquela rede&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:2px 6px;text-align:left&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:2px 6px;text-align:left&quot;&gt;o navegador conecta na porta 8000 do próprio notebook; quem escuta nela é o docker-proxy&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:2px 6px;text-align:left&quot;&gt;2 · ports&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:2px 6px;text-align:left&quot;&gt;o docker-proxy abre outra conexão, de 172.18.0.1 até 172.18.0.4:8000, e copia os bytes nos dois sentidos&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:2px 6px;text-align:left&quot;&gt;ex.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:2px 6px;text-align:left&quot;&gt;IP de 2026-10-22 (pgrep -a docker-proxy); muda a cada container criado; o real aparece com docker network inspect noteproject_default&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:2px 6px;text-align:left&quot;&gt;IPs do notebook&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:2px 6px;text-align:left&quot;&gt;ip -4 -br addr em 2026-10-20 (lo, wlan0, br-…)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="670" width="1081" height="116" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
